  "description": "Beloved idol Yoon-Jae Ahn, renowned for his impeccable charm and striking appearance, secures a coveted spot on a popular variety show, boosting his solo career. Just as he’s savoring success, his forgotten past resurfaces, threatening his celebrity status. Can Yoon-Jae shield his career from the looming secrets? With stakes at their highest, will his charm and unwavering determination prove sufficient to conquer the ghosts of his past? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
